       RAR, beta = 0                          chi2 =    204.3/7  mean g_pred/g_obs = 0.6157  (non-monotone M_dyn: 0)
       RAR, beta = +0.17188 (Run R, frozen)   chi2 =    311.7/7  mean g_pred/g_obs = 0.3612  (non-monotone M_dyn: 0)

   B2  model comparison at matched parameter count.
       Inside one class a class indicator IS a free amplitude, so M1 is
       the primary null.  M3 and M4 are the competitors that can reshape
